" data-mce-resize=3D"false">7</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Deactivated employees</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Number of deactivated Compass user ids f=
or employees</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">TBC</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <p><br></p>
    <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper"><img class=3D"confl=
uence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" src=3D"f2d2331bf2dbcdb36c02250c28=
c55f7bc7ea6b9331d082a463110bd583a7ae4c" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachm=
ents/2715081356/image-2026-5-14_15-21-12.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDa=
te=3D1778786472253&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-l=
inked-resource-id=3D"2726044141" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-li=
nked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"ima=
ge-2026-5-14_15-21-12.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca" data-linke=
d-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"=
2715081356" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"29" tabindex=3D"0" al=
t=3D"" width=3D"468" height=3D"306"></span></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h1 id=3D"Employeeaccessusertransitionstrategy-Problemstosolve">Problem=
s to solve</h1>
    <ol>
     <li data-uuid=3D"be6d73e9-8349-4ad8-89e5-c3357e8eb44c"><strong>Primary=
 accounts:</strong> All employees who currently have Compass access must be=
 assigned a primary account provisioned via IIQ&nbsp;=20
      <ol>
       <li data-uuid=3D"4c9cbdd6-d200-4fec-95f9-608b595157fc">Must only con=
sider existing Compass user ids setup in an internal firm (firm id: COR or =
NBIN), one user account per employee</li>
       <li>Their access provision should be aligned to their job role, as s=
pecified in the internal access matrix</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"0e7d4bd0-0d38-4349-afb4-51fd19879959">Email domains=
 nbc.ca and bnc.ca must be interchangeable =E2=86=90 confirmed by IIQ but s=
hould be tested</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"8310fdf2-f96f-48a0-87c7-b4a9081e974b">Cleanup consi=
deration:&nbsp;=20
        <ol>
         <li data-uuid=3D"3ef26f95-9b79-4ae0-b297-f44924a887ac">Email addr =
must be either nbc.ca or bnc.ca</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"4e7ac4e6-4c0d-4ccf-9c71-024eabdb8c04">User accoun=
ts which are not linked to a person, a legit Bank email address, most likel=
y test user accounts, e.g. compassx.operation, must not be created as a pri=
mary account.&nbsp;</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"4e80d6d2-c342-468f-925e-f02679776dcb">User accoun=
ts without a<strong> linked R2 id </strong>must be inspected before continu=
ing to leave it blank (there is a cost to add R2 id later)</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"1e7bd6c1-fd03-4a7b-ac90-93403094d04a">Similarly, =
user accounts with trading capability but without a<strong> linked OSS id</=
strong> must be inspected too</li>
        </ol></li>
      </ol></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"7ffa1d00-8b68-488f-a8f5-7c202025578c"><strong>Seconda=
ry accounts:&nbsp;</strong>Only eligible employees should be assigned a sec=
ondary account=20
      <ol>
       <li>Eligibility of additional account is specified in the internal a=
ccess matrix based on their job role</li>
       <li>Secondary accounts must be set up with the email address linked =
to their primary account (for Person table setup and for profile linkage)</=
li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"aecdf345-1cdf-494c-8851-126d869df336">Cleanup consi=
deration:=20
        <ol>
         <li data-uuid=3D"171e5b36-a262-473b-9fd1-6d088f5e58fd">For those w=
ho have an additional accounts but their job role does not specify the elig=
ibility, delete them unless there is a manager discretion</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"f45212be-fe64-4aa6-af08-c88b5983df0b">Challenge t=
hose test accounts set up under a client firm =E2=86=92 is it still necessa=
ry?</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"b7b273b6-10da-416d-bc85-5353cfbf6885"><span style=
=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Challenge employees who have more than one addi=
tional accounts =E2=86=92 consolidate into one?</span></li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"47857cb0-586e-44c6-a421-96bdac89d308">Group email=
 address must be updated to personal work email address - NO exception</li>
        </ol></li>
      </ol></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"e8c76b63-0372-4a5c-9d93-0ab98b6a542d"><strong>DWH use=
r accounts:</strong> Existing DWH user accounts (by shortId) in Compass db =
and Okta NBC tenant must not interfere the primary account setup&nbsp;=20
      <ol>
       <li data-uuid=3D"b0554a4f-7b1c-4422-80da-a5c05b8690d8">The "merge" o=
f CX access and DWH app access should be taken care by the tech solution wh=
en creating the primary accounts</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"24bff30a-74fa-4267-839c-6b2b919f34b9">No disruption=
 to DWH app access for existing employees=20
        <ol>
         <li data-uuid=3D"b21d7231-2028-495c-9ede-cae2f2521b59">The shortId=
 accounts must retain the assigned DWH resources (resource type =3D "dwh_ui=
_module") in Compass</li>
        </ol></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"2cd14bc3-020c-4c0e-a0cb-a307202ccd4d">Cleanup consi=
deration:&nbsp;=20
        <ol>
         <li data-uuid=3D"8b120f7f-b39a-4dc4-8173-bf1de5234b15">Unused acco=
unts, duplicated accounts and accounts for departed employees must be purge=
d before user transition&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
        </ol></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"0be85b0c-e511-4950-bbd4-50a6d85fac0d">Enable DWH ap=
p onboarding of: (1) additional DWH app to existing employees and (2) new e=
mployees&nbsp;</li>
      </ol></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"07ff44f0-8baf-464d-b1b9-77733e0b696e"><strong>Existin=
g external user accounts:&nbsp;</strong>External user ids of employees must=
 be deactivated or deleted; they must not be linked to the primary account=
=20
      <ol>
       <li data-uuid=3D"3394229d-6670-4ba6-ab73-eef901b3ae43">Expectation (=
after user transition launch):=20
        <ol>
         <li data-uuid=3D"8c81c719-8e09-4045-abf8-f0faa7072aff">On User adm=
in page, there must be only one primary account, the shortId account, showi=
ng per person; the external user id must not appear or be maintainable by a=
dmin</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"47030603-86d6-4ddc-a3a6-d74fca08527c">Employees m=
ust not be able to log in with their external user id via Login page once t=
he transition is completed; nor able to reset password or 2FA</li>
        </ol></li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"5ca5c31f-bd92-405a-b10e-51d548b13f62">Tech solution=
 should consider "backup" for rollback situation - - TBC</li>
      </ol></li>
    </ol>
    <p><br></p>
    <h1 id=3D"Employeeaccessusertransitionstrategy-Questions&amp;Concerns">=
Questions &amp; Concerns</h1>
    <ol>
     <li data-uuid=3D"f5f36468-02ba-4319-bbee-598ab79bf079"><strong>DWH use=
r accounts:</strong> How to enable DWH access and Compass access co-exist f=
or a shortId in Okta NBC tenant? What to do with the 450+ DWH user accounts=
 in Compass db so that CX primary account creation is not blocked?<em><stro=
ng> --Resolved</strong></em></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"8771c0d3-d81e-47cb-b9bc-ac7e780480f9"><strong>Existin=
g external user accounts:</strong> Can IIQ bulk insert the primary accounts=
 by the same email addr already exists for the employee (person)? If not, c=
an we bulk change the employee email addr to something else for the moment,=
 which would invalidate the email auth process if the external id is still =
in use?&nbsp;<em><strong> --Part of the tech solution</strong></em></li>
    </ol>
    <p><br></p>
    <h1 id=3D"Employeeaccessusertransitionstrategy-Out-of-scope">Out-of-sco=
pe&nbsp;</h1>
    <ol>
     <li data-uuid=3D"91f2d30f-5e1a-4822-82f6-990e7846df47">Creating new Co=
mpass access=20
      <ol>
       <li data-uuid=3D"a8b2ee8f-6022-43d4-a699-749ad79200e0">The Plan does=
 not handle "new" Compass access requests but only transition employees who=
 are on Compass by <em><strong>the cut-off date (tbc)&nbsp;</strong></em></=
li>
      </ol></li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"0c51e74a-45ef-4b9f-87c6-e82a5be9867e">Tiding their pa=
st user history records to the shortId account=20
      <ol>
       <li>The solution should NOT consider linking the user history of the=
 external user id to the new shortId after transition</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"f7891095-0559-4c95-94f7-a7f714c6a0e5">Business deci=
sion: User history of employees' external user ids is retrievable (offline =
or via archive) upon request</li>
      </ol></li>
    </ol>
    <h1 id=3D"Employeeaccessusertransitionstrategy-Assumption">Assumption</=
h1>
    <ol>
     <li>Same set of <strong>user packages and user groups </strong>in Okta=
 External tenant and Okta NBC tenant=20
      <ol>
       <li data-uuid=3D"53ebfb11-1adc-4566-876c-cea7ff2be5ad">Business deci=
sion: It is understood that some user packages (e.g. Global Admin, Manage U=
sers) should be assignable to employee accounts only; however, do not requi=
re to introduce internal user packages vs. external user packages because:&=
nbsp;=20
        <ol>
         <li data-uuid=3D"644aecaa-969c-41df-a8d4-167f0ea1923b">Employee ac=
counts are auto-provisioned by IIQ with reference to the access matrix, pro=
tecting job roles being assigned to wrong user package/group</li>
         <li data-uuid=3D"28fe7573-9ed5-4bef-ab7b-2beba40075c0">For client =
accounts, user roles are evaluated by the "SAA access matrix" based on sele=
ctions on user access request form, ensuring the proper user assignment; th=
ough there is a chance of human error in choosing the wrong package name in=
 the tool, all actions are logged for audit purpose.&nbsp;</li>
        </ol></li>
      </ol></li>
    </ol>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><br></p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class=3D"columnLayout single" data-layout=3D"single">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h1 id=3D"Employeeaccessusertransitionstrategy-Techsolution-Initialload=
(one-timeload)">Tech solution - Initial load (one-time load)</h1>
    <p><br></p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 86.5951%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 23.4636%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 76.493%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th colspan=3D"2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <h2 id=3D"Employeeaccessusertransitionstrategy-Definition">Definit=
ion</h2></th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Problem to solve</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"e2eab9ac-aceb-4d75-9159-5b83227d32f1">Move curre=
nt employees' primary Compass access from external web login to internal SS=
O&nbsp;</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"9dc8f74e-a193-4605-9118-c76f02631ccd">Maintain t=
heir DWH access, if exists</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Target Users</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Employees who have access to Compass onl=
y, or both Compass and DWH; around 320+&nbsp;</td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Requirements</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
          <p><strong>Employee access initial load workflow (for requirement=
 discussion, not implementation)</strong></p>
          <p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"wid=
th:600px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"30ec40cc86097690f83f1ea09732c1d628105e453=
de89618ded844b06eabcaa5" height=3D"341"></p>
          <p style=3D"font-weight: bold;"><br></p>
          <p><strong>Prerequisites: User list preparation</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li>Product team shall clean up existing CX user accounts of emp=
loyees and prepare a user list with <em>required data columns (TBC), for in=
stance:</em>
            <ul>
             <li data-uuid=3D"b1cfceb0-b73a-479c-b357-8cbc766ac14a"><em>fir=
st name, last name, email address</em></li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"211bf021-49cc-40c6-984f-fc8ce557f2cd"><em>sho=
rtId</em></li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"ddecda5f-3646-435d-980c-1010bb1eecb4"><em>ext=
ernal user id</em></li>
             <li data-uuid=3D"6a6a3ab5-5fbc-44f0-a680-18905c7ec3dc"><em>job=
 role</em></li>
            </ul></li>
          </ul>
          <p style=3D"font-weight: bold;"><br></p>
          <p style=3D"font-weight: bold;"><strong>1. User list upload and v=
alidation</strong></p>
          <p>:question: <em>Which team owns it? When and where in the seque=
nce to call it?</em></p>
          <p>In the followings, if TRUE, the user record (row) shall be inv=
alidated:</p>
          <ol>
           <li data-uuid=3D"134af3e9-1dd5-497d-b534-b2f839eb10e3">Any of th=
e listed columns is blank</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"1e5d9e06-0b9e-4730-9f88-03b8dd141073">shortId i=
s invalid (not found in the network)</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"f661f2b4-5964-4c12-b239-6018ea9bc346">external =
user id is invalid (not found in FUM or is inactive)</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"d44c3737-7862-484b-913f-bd08d1cc3dc7">job role =
is invalid (not found in Compass internal access matrix)</li>
          </ol>
          <p><br></p>
          <p><strong>2. IIQ - Okta profile management</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"5ca41c92-a57c-4dce-81ca-fc303f6ac672">Add Compa=
ss access for the listed shortId's in bulk</li>
          </ul>
          <p><br></p>
          <p><strong>3. IIQ &amp; FUM - Compass user profile management</st=
rong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"d7e74908-4291-4a9f-8672-25a85c3fc2c1">Create or=
 update the CX account by the listed shortId's accordingly</li>
           <li data-uuid=3D"16a568f0-36f9-4fea-a811-504869d1e28c">If the sh=
ortId account has DWH resources assigned to previously, re-apply&nbsp;</li>
          </ul>
          <p><br></p>
          <p><strong>4. FUM - Update linked system Id's</strong></p>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"8de1d8ae-9902-4f96-af8f-99d238953b52">Retrieve =
the OSS Id and R2 Id by the external user id (in user list), and apply to t=
he respective shortId account</li>
          </ul>
          <p><br></p>
          <p><strong>5. FUM - Sunset the external user accounts</strong></p=
>
          <ul>
           <li data-uuid=3D"c99a1777-7490-4fc4-9b49-91c8280a114c">Disable t=
he login and user admin accessibility of the external user id's</li>
          </ul>
          <p><br></p>
         </div></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Non-Functional</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"aafd8224-b33b-4f18-b3fb-49b672c784ee">Invalidate=
d user list must be rejected and the process must be halted</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"1e83a80c-12ba-4ed7-a914-4ce441c898b7">System log=
ging and error messaging throughout the process for monitoring and troubles=
hooting</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"c5ceb6cd-1355-4f0e-9bfb-9d9fdb4695ed">Must retur=
n a response (Success/Fail) through whatever means after the process has fi=
nished&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"d4fbf427-bcfe-4739-b23b-03110014a638">Change aud=
it log must be applied to every CX user account creation, update or user st=
ate change</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Out of Scope</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"209e0162-9e00-454f-ad02-0e34d0af4b14">User profi=
le data cleanup and user list preparation</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"8087a832-f1a9-4772-b836-a9bd5d1a1287">Setup of t=
he secondary or additional IDs&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Acceptance Criteria</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"22598696-f25c-4ab8-bf2b-f15ff8f371e2">Primary em=
ployee accounts of all listed users are successfully set up&nbsp;</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"e0d9eecb-e7c5-4c19-9f5c-477fdc4e9ea2">External u=
ser accounts of the employees are not accessible anymore</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"44b381d0-607a-46b8-9b1d-d80d01393e2f">If existed=
 previously, employees' DWH app access are not impacted</li>
         </ul>
         <p>More details in the User / Test Scenarios below</p></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Dependencies</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"f2c1e21b-3bb1-462e-8176-ee0f24662aa0">NBIN inter=
nal access matrix is finalized and configured in IIQ</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"98e2b204-1775-4ab0-bd45-57740a8b397d">Tech integ=
ration between IIQ and FUM has been completed</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Risks &amp; Constraints</t=
h>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"894d3337-adcb-476a-829c-4bceb17cd612">Risk of du=
plicated Ids - as some shortId employee accounts already exist in FUM, the =
solution must check before creating a new user account</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"e74365fb-fdfc-42cb-8f17-46dd6baaa79a">Risk of DW=
H resources being removed - as these resources are not managed in the IIQ p=
rocess, FUM will have to handle them&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Key Assumptions</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"c2689553-6ebc-49e1-910a-cfabce64929f">From entit=
lement perspective, Compass access and DWH access may co-exist for any give=
n shortId employee account</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3d2a301f-0039-4f85-ad98-cf2e8661c063">No require=
ment on linking the external user account (replaced) to the shortId account=
 or maintaining user history on the external user account</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Open Questions :question:&=
nbsp;</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"29b11734-c386-4ddb-adcf-c73702c8b386">How would =
the process be kicked off? The first task must validate the input user list=
.</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"f8ecd143-4cf0-4c06-be6b-240078899684">What are t=
he data (columns) required in the user list file?&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <h2 id=3D"Employeeaccessusertransitionstrategy-User/TestScenarios">User=
 / Test&nbsp;Scenarios</h2>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" data-snooker-c=
ol-series=3D"numbers" data-snooker-locked-cols=3D"0" style=3D"width: 100.97=
2%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 5.28278%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 12.5078%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 21.0534%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 16.0814%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 16.5475%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 13.207%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 15.3045%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTh" contenteditable=3D"false=
" data-mce-resize=3D"false" scope=3D"col"><br></th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Title</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Criteria</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Expected Output</th>
        <th colspan=3D"3" scope=3D"colgroup" class=3D"confluenceTh">Accepta=
nce Criteria</th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTh" contenteditable=3D"false=
" data-mce-resize=3D"false" scope=3D"col"><br></th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Persona: Compass admin use=
r and any internal user (view-only)</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Persona: DWH admin user</t=
h>
